    "detailed_description": "Mars First Logistics is an open world physics simulation game where you design and build mechanized rovers to deliver stuff. Play solo or with up to 3 friends in online co-op!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Design and assemble your rover using an intuitive and tactile editor! Combine over 80 parts including springs, hydraulic cylinders, servo motors, rocket engines and many more to tailor your creations to the unique challenges of each job, or just let your imagination run wild.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Pilot your creations across the vast, procedurally generated terrain of Mars. Heavy cargo, fragile cargo, bouncy cargo, cargo that\u2019s trying to float away \u2013 you never know what new challenges lay around the corner!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Help the Martians by moving their awkwardly shaped cargo from place to place. With each successful delivery you'll earn funds, unlock new parts, and contribute to developing the space settlement with a variety of fun new structures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intuitive, Flexible Building:</strong> Make your rovers as simple or complex as you\u2019d like! Create anything you want, no matter how ridiculous.<br></li><li><strong>Sky\u2019s The Limit:</strong> No one right answer leaves success up to your creativity and ingenuity. <br></li><li><strong>Open World:</strong> Traverse the striking, procedurally generated open world, with new challenges over every horizon.<br></li><li><strong>Make Mars Home:</strong> Connect and build stations using roads, monorails, power lines, water pipes and more while developing fun new areas!<br></li><li><strong>Unlock Parts:</strong> Unlock and combine parts like servo motors, hydraulic cylinders and rocket engines. <br></li><li><strong>Co-op:</strong> Tackle the challenge solo, or recruit up to 3 friends in online co-op.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Mars First Logistics is an open world physics simulation game where you design and build mechanized rovers to deliver stuff. Play solo or with up to 3 friends in online co-op!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/132dc59f5b8eb66fde13d5c2d4ba28cc.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Design and assemble your rover using an intuitive and tactile editor! Combine over 80 parts including springs, hydraulic cylinders, servo motors, rocket engines and many more to tailor your creations to the unique challenges of each job, or just let your imagination run wild.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/9404897df446f9f26836ae45d4da0771.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Pilot your creations across the vast, procedurally generated terrain of Mars. Heavy cargo, fragile cargo, bouncy cargo, cargo that\u2019s trying to float away \u2013 you never know what new challenges lay around the corner!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.poster.avif?t=1749338151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.webm?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/extras/8d27a880c0800c749af6c77f74dabe67.mp4?t=1749338151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Help the Martians by moving their awkwardly shaped cargo from place to place. With each successful delivery you'll earn funds, unlock new parts, and contribute to developing the space settlement with a variety of fun new structures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intuitive, Flexible Building:</strong> Make your rovers as simple or complex as you\u2019d like! Create anything you want, no matter how ridiculous.<br></li><li><strong>Sky\u2019s The Limit:</strong> No one right answer leaves success up to your creativity and ingenuity. <br></li><li><strong>Open World:</strong> Traverse the striking, procedurally generated open world, with new challenges over every horizon.<br></li><li><strong>Make Mars Home:</strong> Connect and build stations using roads, monorails, power lines, water pipes and more while developing fun new areas!<br></li><li><strong>Unlock Parts:</strong> Unlock and combine parts like servo motors, hydraulic cylinders and rocket engines. <br></li><li><strong>Co-op:</strong> Tackle the challenge solo, or recruit up to 3 friends in online co-op.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build physically simulated rovers to transport awkwardly shaped cargo across the rugged terrain of Mars. Earn funds, unlock new parts, and use your ingenuity to help the Martians establish a new home. Playable solo or in online co-op!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cMars First Logistics Is A Deeply Funny Video Game\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cMars First Logistics is even more delightful than it looks\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIf you're the type of person who builds mechas in Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom, you'll probably have a field day with Mars First Logistics.\u201d<br>Mashable<br>",
